    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3649" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκρότητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not beaten down</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				9.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>not struck together</i> or <i>in unison</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλη πάραυλα κἀκρότητα κύμβαλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Trag.Adesp.</u>
					93
				</span></i>
			
			=
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
				1254
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἀποψάλακτος</span>
			.</div>
